      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a very high level of personal stress and perhaps some anxiety about external scrutiny, which is a heavy burden to carry. If you feel like you are under constant observation, it is wise to seek support from a mental health professional who can help you manage these feelings. They can provide you with coping strategies and tools to navigate this intense pressure in a healthy way.",
